@startuml Training Mode Management Use Case
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  BorderColor #333333
  ArrowColor #333333
}
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #666666
}

title Training Mode Management Use Case Diagram

rectangle "HotelEase System" {
  usecase "Toggle Training Mode" as UC1
  usecase "Generate Session Code" as UC2
  usecase "Set TTL Expiry" as UC3
  usecase "Sign In Anonymously" as UC4
  usecase "Select Role" as UC5
  usecase "Perform Operations" as UC6
  usecase "Reset Training Data" as UC7
  usecase "Clear Sandboxed Collections" as UC8
}

actor "Admin" as Admin
actor "Student" as Student

Admin --> UC1
Admin --> UC2
Admin --> UC7
UC1 --> UC3
UC2 --> UC3
UC3 --> Student
Student --> UC4
UC4 --> UC5
UC5 --> UC6
UC7 --> UC8

note right of UC1
  Admin toggles Training
  Mode ON/OFF. When enabled,
  all operations route to
  sandboxed collections
  (training_ prefix).
end note

note bottom of UC2
  Admin generates
  time-limited session
  codes for students.
end note

note bottom of UC6
  All student actions
  write to training_
  collections, isolated
  from production.
end note

note bottom of UC7
  Admin resets training
  data to clear all
  sandboxed records
  between sessions.
end note

@enduml
